# IMPL-PERM_REPORT_CLI essence pseudocode

<!-- [IMPL-PERM_REPORT_CLI] [ARCH-MACOS_PERM_REPORT] [REQ-MACOS_PERM_REPORT] — CLI entry orchestration -->

## PARSE_ARGS

```
INPUT: process.argv
OUTPUT: CliOptions { permissions[], status, format, resolveNames }
PRE: platform is darwin
POST: unknown permission alias -> exit 1 before DB access
FAILURE_MODES: invalid --status or --format -> exit 1 with stderr message
```

## RUN_PIPELINE

```
INPUT: CliOptions
OUTPUT: formatted report on stdout
CONTROL:
  1. RESOLVE_ALIASES (catalog)
  2. RESOLVE_TCC_PATHS + query user and system DBs (reader)
  3. MERGE_RESULTS
  4. BUILD_REPORT + optional name resolution
  5. EMIT_JSON_V1 or EMIT_TABLE
TERMINATION: returns when stdout written
```

## MAP_EXIT_CODE

```
INPUT: warnings[], rowsRead count
OUTPUT: exit code integer
POST: 0 if at least one DB readable; 2 if none readable; 1 reserved for arg errors (handled in PARSE_ARGS)
```
